  "description": "Production-ready cache abstraction for .NET 8 with In-Memory caching, extensible external storage, tag-based invalidation, HTTP response caching, and OpenTelemetry metrics.",
  "id": "CoreSystem.Cache",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-12T22:56:20.463Z",
